      "name": "riki_tricks_of_the_trade",
      "id": 5145,
      "name_zh": "绝杀秘技",
      "name_en": "Tricks of the Trade",
      "description_zh": "持续施法 - 力丸转移出现实位面，每隔一段时间从背后随机攻击附近的%interval_targets%个随机敌方单位。期间他的攻击伤害为固定值。",
      "description_en": "CHANNELED - Riki phases out of the world and periodically strikes %interval_targets% random enemy units from behind in an area around him. He has fixed attack damage while phased out.",
      "notes_zh": [],
      "notes_en": [],
      "source_collection": "abilities",
      "source_pointer": "/result/data/heroes/0/abilities/2",
      "innate": false,
      "granted_by_scepter": false,
      "granted_by_shard": false,
      "upgrade_text": {
        "scepter_loc": {
          "en": "Increases Cast Range to %AbilityCastRange%. Allows you to target an allied unit, hiding inside them for the duration. While hiding in an allied unit, they have %scepter_movespeed%%% bonus movement speed, and Tricks of the Trade lasts %scepter_bonus_duration%s longer and does an additional %scepter_bonus_attacks% attacks.",
          "zh": "提升施法距离至%AbilityCastRange%。可以对友方单位施放，持续时间内藏在他们体内。藏在友方单位体内时，他会拥有%scepter_movespeed%%%移动速度加成，同时绝杀秘技的持续时间提升%scepter_bonus_duration%秒，并且额外发动%scepter_bonus_attacks%次攻击。"
        },
        "shard_loc": {
          "en": "",
          "zh": ""
        }
      },
      "facet_text_en": [
        "",
        "Tricks of the Trade has %creep_agility_multiplier%x Agility Bonus when attacking non-hero units. When Riki kills a non-hero unit during Tricks of the Trade, the cooldown is reduced by %cooldown_reduction_per_creep_kill%s.",
        ""
      ],
      "facet_text_zh": [
        "",
        "绝杀秘技攻击非英雄单位时拥有%creep_agility_multiplier%倍敏捷加成。只要力丸在绝杀秘技期间击杀一个非英雄单位，冷却时间就会减少%cooldown_reduction_per_creep_kill%秒。",
        ""
      ],
